[00:27.32] On the rise of a new dawning
[00:30.96] I gaze upon a pagan mass
[00:34.40] Who cry in tones of victory
[00:37.77] And hail their Gods in the skies
[00:41.23] Their shields and armor are glittering
[00:44.79] Under the heat of a heathen Sun
[00:48.02] Their hearts race with the pride
[00:51.52] To follow their fathers long gone
[00:55.05] The blades of the weapons are bloody
[00:58.38] Wet with fresh christian blood
[01:01.79] Storming through the battlefields
[01:05.15] For the pantheon of their Gods
[01:08.53] They march through the fields of glory
[01:12.08] On which they've led so many lives
[01:15.46] They ride their steeds to new frontiers
[01:18.74] Forever more in the night...
[01:22.38] Ahhh... Marching of the Hordes...
[01:29.17] Against a sky tinted crimson red
[01:32.79] Over the blood soaked meadows
[01:43.01] Through the ashes of the Shamanic Flames
[01:46.44] From the Anatolian Shadows...